                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <script>
            var policyDetails = {
                'attendance-policy': {
                    category: 'Attendance & Time',
                    title: 'Attendance & Punctuality Policy',
                    body: `
                        <h5>1. Purpose & Scope</h5>
                        <p>This policy outlines punctuality standards, daily log-in and log-out obligations, and shift schedules for all employees of the organization.</p>
                        
                        <h5>2. Office Hours & Grace Period</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Standard operating office hours are <strong>9:00 AM to 6:00 PM</strong> (Monday through Friday).</li>
                            <li>A grace window of <strong>15 minutes</strong> is allowed for check-in. Arrivals past 9:15 AM without manager notice will be flagged as <em>Late</em>.</li>
                            <li>Three consecutive unexplained late arrivals may result in half-day deduction.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h5>3. Check-In & Check-Out Requirement</h5>
                        <p>Every employee must record their official punch times via the HR Attendance dashboard. Proxy punch or login credential sharing is strictly prohibited.</p>
                    `
                },
                'leave-policy': {
                    category: 'Leave & Time-Off',
                    title: 'Annual Leave & Time-Off Policy',
                    body: `
                        <h5>1. Purpose & Entitlements</h5>
                        <p>To provide healthy work-life balance through paid time off while ensuring continuous business operations.</p>
                        
                        <h5>2. Categories of Leave</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Casual Leave (CL):</strong> 12 days per calendar year for personal affairs and family occasions.</li>
                            <li><strong>Sick Leave (SL):</strong> 10 days per year for medical recovery (medical certificate required for > 2 consecutive days).</li>
                            <li><strong>Annual Vacation (Earned Leave):</strong> Accrued monthly, usable for planned holidays with 2 weeks advance notice.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h5>3. Application & Approval Process</h5>
                        <p>All leaves must be submitted electronically via the HR portal. Reporting managers must review and approve before the commencement of time off.</p>
                    `
                },
                'conduct-policy': {
                    category: 'Workplace Ethics',
                    title: 'Workplace Code of Conduct',
                    body: `
                        <h5>1. Core Philosophy</h5>
                        <p>We are committed to maintaining a safe, inclusive, collaborative, and dignified environment for every team member regardless of background.</p>
                        
                        <h5>2. Anti-Harassment & Non-Discrimination</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Zero tolerance for verbal, physical, or digital harassment or discrimination.</li>
                            <li>Open-door grievance escalation directly to senior HR leadership with strict anti-retaliation protection.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h5>3. Professional Integrity</h5>
                        <p>Team members must protect company assets, treat colleagues with respect, and avoid conflicts of interest with external contractors.</p>
                    `
                },
                'payroll-policy': {
                    category: 'Compensation & Benefits',
                    title: 'Payroll, Salary & Reimbursement Policy',
                    body: `
                        <h5>1. Payout Schedule</h5>
                        <p>Salaries are processed and disbursed on the <strong>last working day of each calendar month</strong> directly via direct bank transfer.</p>
                        
                        <h5>2. Salary Components</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Basic Pay:</strong> 50% of Total CTC component.</li>
                            <li><strong>HRA:</strong> 40-50% allowance based on metropolitan residency.</li>
                            <li><strong>Other Allowances:</strong> Special allowances, conveyance, and performance incentives.</li>
                            <li><strong>Statutory Deductions:</strong> Applicable tax (TDS) and provident fund contributions.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h5>3. Salary Slip Access</h5>
                        <p>Itemized printable salary slips are generated immediately following payroll authorization and accessible through the user profile.</p>
                    `
                },
                'security-policy': {
                    category: 'Security & NDA',
                    title: 'Data Protection & Confidentiality Policy',
                    body: `
                        <h5>1. Confidential Company Data</h5>
                        <p>All source code, financial reports, client databases, and internal communications are strictly classified as proprietary assets.</p>
                        
                        <h5>2. Information Security Protocols</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Mandatory use of multi-factor authentication (MFA) and strong passwords.</li>
                            <li>Prohibition of copying client or employee personal data onto unapproved personal drives or third-party servers.</li>
                            <li>Immediate reporting of lost devices or security breaches to the IT department within 2 hours.</li>
                        </ul>
                    `
                },
                'remote-policy': {
                    category: 'Operations',
                    title: 'Remote & Hybrid Work Policy',
                    body: `
                        <h5>1. Eligibility & Core Principles</h5>
                        <p>Hybrid and remote work arrangements are offered to foster productivity while preserving team connectivity and accountability.</p>
                        
                        <h5>2. Operating Guidelines</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Remote team members must be available on communication channels (Slack/Email/Phone) during core collaboration hours (10:00 AM - 5:00 PM).</li>
                            <li>Daily attendance logs (check-in and check-out) must be entered via the HR Attendance dashboard just like on-site work.</li>
                            <li>High-speed internet connection and quiet working workspace required for client calls.</li>
                        </ul>
                    `
                }
            };

            function openPolicyModal(key) {
                var p = policyDetails[key];
                if (!p) return;

                document.getElementById('modalPolicyCat').innerText = p.category;
                document.getElementById('modalPolicyTitle').innerText = p.title;
                document.getElementById('modalPolicyBody').innerHTML = p.body;

                var overlay = document.getElementById('policyModalOverlay');
                overlay.classList.add('show');
                document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
            }

            function closePolicyModal(e) {
                if (e && e.target && e.target !== document.getElementById('policyModalOverlay')) {
                    return;
                }
                var overlay = document.getElementById('policyModalOverlay');
                overlay.classList.remove('show');
                document.body.style.overflow = '';
            }

            function downloadPolicyNotice(policyName) {
                alert("Downloading: " + policyName + "\n\nIn a production environment, this triggers a direct PDF download of the signed company governance document.");
            }

            function filterCategory(cat, btn) {
                // Update active tab button
                var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.policy-tab-btn');
                btns.forEach(function(b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
                btn.classList.add('active');

                var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.policy-card');
                cards.forEach(function(card) {
                    if (cat === 'all' || card.getAttribute('data-category') === cat) {
                        card.style.display = 'flex';
                    } else {
                        card.style.display = 'none';
                    }
                });
            }

            function filterPolicies() {
                var q = document.getElementById('policySearchInput').value.toLowerCase().trim();
                var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.policy-card');

                cards.forEach(function(card) {
                    var title = card.getAttribute('data-title') || '';
                    var text = card.textContent.toLowerCase();
                    if (title.includes(q) || text.includes(q)) {
                        card.style.display = 'flex';
                    } else {
                        card.style.display = 'none';
                    }
                });
            }
        </script>
    }
    else if (pageType == "engage")
    {
        var announcementsList = ViewBag.Announcements as List<CompanyAnnouncement> ?? new List<CompanyAnnouncement>();
        var companyEventsList = ViewBag.CompanyEvents as List<CompanyEvent> ?? new List<CompanyEvent>();
        var holidaysList = ViewBag.Holidays as List<CompanyEvent> ?? new List<CompanyEvent>();
        var celebrationsList = ViewBag.Celebrations as List<EmployeeCelebration> ?? new List<EmployeeCelebration>();
        var activeEmployeesList = ViewBag.ActiveEmployees as List<Employee> ?? new List<Employee>();
        var postsList = ViewBag.Posts as List<EngagementPost> ?? new List<EngagementPost>();

        var nextHoliday = holidaysList.Where(h => h.EventDate.Date >= DateTime.Today).OrderBy(h => h.EventDate).FirstOrDefault();
        var totalEvents = companyEventsList.Count + holidaysList.Count;
        var totalMilestones = celebrationsList.Count + activeEmployeesList.Count;
        bool isHr = User.IsInRole("HR");

        <!-- =========================================================
             ENGAGE PAGE - DYNAMIC ACTIVITIES, NEWS & EVENTS
             ========================================================= -->
        <div class="engage-page">

            <!-- HERO SECTION -->
            <section class="engage-hero">
                <div class="engage-container">
                    <div class="engage-breadcrumb">
                        <a asp-controller="Dashboard" asp-action="Index"><i class="bi bi-house-door me-1"></i>Home</a>
                        <i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i>
                        <span>Company</span>
                        <i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i>
                        <span>Engage</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="engage-hero-content">
                        <div class="engage-hero-text">
                            <div class="engage-badge">
                                <span class="dot"></span>
                                Workplace Community &amp; Culture Hub
                            </div>
                            <h1>Engage – <span>Activities, News &amp; Events</span></h1>
                            <p>
                                Stay informed with official company announcements, keep track of holidays &amp; team events,
                                celebrate teammate birthdays &amp; work milestones, and participate in lively workplace activities.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Hero Quick Stats (Real Dynamic Counts) -->
                        <div class="engage-hero-stats">
                            <div class="engage-stat-box">
                                <i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="val">@announcementsList.Count</div>
                                    <div class="lbl">Announcements</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engage-stat-box">
                                <i class="bi bi-calendar-event-fill"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="val">@totalEvents</div>
                                    <div class="lbl">Events &amp; Holidays</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engage-stat-box">
                                <i class="bi bi-gift-fill"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="val">@totalMilestones</div>
                                    <div class="lbl">Celebrations</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engage-stat-box">
                                <i class="bi bi-chat-heart-fill"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="val">@postsList.Count</div>
                                    <div class="lbl">Activities</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- BREAKING NEWS TICKER -->
            <div class="engage-ticker">
                <div class="ticker-pill">
                    <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill"></i> Latest
                </div>
                <div class="ticker-msg">
                    @if (announcementsList.Any())
                    {
                        var latestAnn = announcementsList.First();
                        <strong>@latestAnn.Title:</strong> @(latestAnn.Content.Length > 120 ? latestAnn.Content.Substring(0, 120) + "..." : latestAnn.Content)
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <strong>HR Notice Board:</strong> <span>Welcome to HR Attendance Engage! Official announcements and notices added by HR will appear here.</span>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STICKY SUB-NAVIGATION TABS -->
            <nav class="engage-nav-tabs">
                <div class="engage-container">
                    <div class="engage-tabs-scroll">
                        <button type="button" class="tab-nav-btn active" onclick="switchEngageSection('all', this)">
                            <i class="bi bi-grid-1x2-fill"></i> All Highlights
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="tab-nav-btn" onclick="switchEngageSection('announcements', this)">
                            <i class="bi bi-newspaper"></i> Announcements &amp; News
                            <span class="pill-badge">@announcementsList.Count</span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="tab-nav-btn" onclick="switchEngageSection('events-calendar', this)">
                            <i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i> Events &amp; Holidays
                            <span class="pill-badge">@totalEvents</span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="tab-nav-btn" onclick="switchEngageSection('celebrations', this)">
                            <i class="bi bi-cake2-fill"></i> Birthdays &amp; Anniversaries
                            <span class="pill-badge">@totalMilestones</span>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="tab-nav-btn" onclick="switchEngageSection('activities', this)">
                            <i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> Activities &amp; Social Feed
                            <span class="pill-badge">@postsList.Count</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </nav>

            <!-- MAIN BODY CONTENT -->
            <div class="engage-content-body">
                <div class="engage-container">

                    <!-- =====================================================
                       SECTION 1: COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENTS & NEWS
                       ===================================================== -->
                    <section class="engage-block-section" id="block-announcements">
                        <div class="engage-block-header">
                            <div class="block-title-wrap">
                                <div class="block-icon-circle purple">
                                    <i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h2>Company Announcements &amp; News</h2>
                                    <p>Official updates, company notices, policy releases, and organization achievements.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <button type="button" class="btn-post-announcement" onclick="openCreateNoticeModal()">
                                    <i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill"></i> Post Announcement
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Filter Bar & Search -->
                        <div class="announcements-filter-bar">
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn-pill active" onclick="filterNewsByCat('all', this)">All (@announcementsList.Count)</button>
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn-pill" onclick="filterNewsByCat('Policy', this)">Policies</button>
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn-pill" onclick="filterNewsByCat('Milestone', this)">Milestones</button>
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn-pill" onclick="filterNewsByCat('Tech', this)">Tech</button>
                            <button type="button" class="filter-btn-pill" onclick="filterNewsByCat('Culture', this)">Culture</button>

                            <div class="announcements-search-box">
                                <i class="bi bi-search"></i>
                                <input type="text" id="newsSearchInput" placeholder="Search announcements..." onkeyup="searchNewsCards()" />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Announcements Cards Grid (DYNAMIC) -->
                        <div class="announcements-cards-grid" id="newsCardsGrid">
                            @if (!announcementsList.Any())
                            {
                                <div class="empty-engage-state">
                                    <i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i>
                                    <h4>No Announcements Published Yet</h4>
                                    <p>No official company announcement has been posted by HR yet. Click the button below to publish a new announcement.</p>
                                    <button type="button" class="btn-post-announcement mt-2" onclick="openCreateNoticeModal()">
                                        <i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill"></i> Post Announcement
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                @foreach (var ann in announcementsList)
                                {
                                    string tagClass = ann.Category switch
                                    {
                                        "Policy" => "tag-policy",
                                        "Milestone" => "tag-milestone",
                                        "Culture" => "tag-culture",
                                        "Tech" => "tag-tech",
                                        _ => "tag-general"
                                    };

                                    <div class="news-card-item featured" data-cat="@ann.Category" data-search="@ann.Title.ToLower() @ann.Content.ToLower()">
                                        <div class="news-card-top">
                                            <span class="news-category-tag @tagClass">@ann.Category</span>
                                            <span class="news-meta-date">
                                                <i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i>@ann.CreatedAt.ToString("MMM dd, yyyy")
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="news-card-body">
                                            <h3>@ann.Title</h3>
                                            <p>@ann.Content</p>
                                            <div class="news-card-tags">
                                                <span>#@ann.Category</span>
                                                <span>#Official</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="news-card-footer">
                                            <div class="author-info">
                                                <div class="author-circle">@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(ann.AuthorName) ? "HR" : ann.AuthorName.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())</div>
                                                <span>@ann.AuthorName</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-read-story" onclick="showNewsModal('@Html.Raw(ann.Title.Replace("'", "\\'"))', '@Html.Raw(ann.AuthorName.Replace("'", "\\'"))', '@ann.CreatedAt.ToString("MMM dd, yyyy")', '@Html.Raw(ann.Content.Replace("'", "\\'").Replace("\n", " "))')">
                                                    Read Details <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                                                </button>
                                                <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="DeleteAnnouncement" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Are you sure you want to delete this announcement?');" style="display:inline;">
                                                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@ann.Id" />
                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-danger p-0 ms-1" title="Delete Announcement">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-trash3"></i>
                                                    </button>
                                                </form>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            }
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- =====================================================
                       SECTION 2: EVENTS & HOLIDAY CALENDAR
                       ===================================================== -->
                    <section class="engage-block-section" id="block-events-calendar">
                        <div class="engage-block-header">
                            <div class="block-title-wrap">
                                <div class="block-icon-circle blue">
                                    <i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h2>Events &amp; Holiday Calendar</h2>
                                    <p>Upcoming organizational meetups, team celebrations, and official paid holidays.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <button type="button" class="btn-add-event" onclick="openCreateEventModal()">
                                    <i class="bi bi-calendar-plus"></i> Add Event / Holiday
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="events-calendar-grid">

                            <!-- Left: Official Holidays Calendar -->
                            <div class="calendar-box-panel">
                                <div class="panel-header-row">
                                    <h3><i class="bi bi-calendar-heart text-danger"></i> Official Holidays Calendar</h3>
                                    <span class="badge bg-info-subtle text-info border border-info px-2 py-1">@holidaysList.Count Holidays</span>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Countdown Banner (Dynamic) -->
                                @if (nextHoliday != null)
                                {
                                    var daysLeft = (nextHoliday.EventDate.Date - DateTime.Today).Days;
                                    <div class="holiday-countdown-card">
                                        <div class="countdown-desc">
                                            <i class="bi bi-stars"></i>
                                            <div>
                                                <strong>Upcoming Holiday: @nextHoliday.Title</strong>
                                                <span>@nextHoliday.EventDate.ToString("dddd, MMM dd, yyyy") @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(nextHoliday.Description) ? "• " + nextHoliday.Description : "")</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="countdown-days-badge">
                                            @(daysLeft == 0 ? "Today!" : daysLeft + " Days Left")
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                }

                                <!-- Holidays List (Dynamic) -->
                                <div class="holiday-scroll-list">
                                    @if (!holidaysList.Any())
                                    {
                                        <div class="empty-engage-state" style="padding:25px;">
                                            <i class="bi bi-calendar-x" style="font-size:2rem;"></i>
                                            <h4>No Holidays Scheduled</h4>
                                            <p>Official company holidays will appear here once added by HR. Click "Add Event / Holiday" to schedule upcoming holidays.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        @foreach (var hol in holidaysList)
                                        {
                                            <div class="holiday-row-item">
                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                                    <div class="holiday-date-cube">
                                                        <span class="m">@hol.EventDate.ToString("MMM")</span>
                                                        <span class="d">@hol.EventDate.ToString("dd")</span>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="holiday-title-group">
                                                        <h4>@hol.Title</h4>
                                                        <span>@hol.EventDate.ToString("dddd") @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(hol.Location) ? "• " + hol.Location : "")</span>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                    <span class="badge-holiday-type gazetted">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(hol.SubType) ? "Holiday" : hol.SubType)</span>
                                                    <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="DeleteEvent" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this holiday entry?');" style="display:inline;">
                                                        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                                        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@hol.Id" />
                                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-danger p-0" title="Delete">
                                                            <i class="bi bi-trash3"></i>
                                                        </button>
                                                    </form>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        }
                                    }
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Right: Company Events -->
                            <div class="calendar-box-panel">
                                <div class="panel-header-row">
                                    <h3><i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill text-primary"></i> Upcoming Company Events</h3>
                                    <span class="badge bg-info-subtle text-info border border-info px-2 py-1">@companyEventsList.Count Events</span>
                                </div>

                                <div class="events-vertical-list">
                                    @if (!companyEventsList.Any())
                                    {
                                        <div class="empty-engage-state" style="padding:25px;">
                                            <i class="bi bi-calendar-event" style="font-size:2rem;"></i>
                                            <h4>No Events Scheduled</h4>
                                            <p>No upcoming company events, town halls, or meetups are scheduled. Click "Add Event / Holiday" to create one.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        @foreach (var evt in companyEventsList)
                                        {
                                            <div class="event-item-card purple">
                                                <div class="event-item-card-top">
                                                    <span class="event-pill-category">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(evt.SubType) ? "Event" : evt.SubType)</span>
                                                    <span class="text-muted small"><i class="bi bi-calendar-event me-1"></i>@evt.EventDate.ToString("MMM dd, yyyy")</span>
                                                </div>
                                                <h4>@evt.Title</h4>
                                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(evt.Location))
                                                {
                                                    <div class="event-details-meta">
                                                        <span><i class="bi bi-geo-alt text-danger"></i> @evt.Location</span>
                                                    </div>
                                                }
                                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(evt.Description))
                                                {
                                                    <p class="small text-muted mb-2">@evt.Description</p>
                                                }
                                                <div class="event-bottom-bar">
                                                    <div class="rsvp-attendee-count">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-people-fill text-primary"></i> <span id="event-rsvp-val-@evt.Id">@evt.RsvpCount</span> attending
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn-rsvp-toggle" onclick="toggleEventAttendance(@evt.Id, 'event-rsvp-val-@evt.Id', this)">
                                                            <i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> RSVP Now
                                                        </button>
                                                        <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="DeleteEvent" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this event?');" style="display:inline;">
                                                            @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                                            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@evt.Id" />
                                                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-danger p-0" title="Delete">
                                                                <i class="bi bi-trash3"></i>
                                                            </button>
                                                        </form>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        }
                                    }
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- =====================================================
                       SECTION 3: EMPLOYEE BIRTHDAYS & WORK ANNIVERSARIES
                       ===================================================== -->
                    <section class="engage-block-section" id="block-celebrations">
                        <div class="engage-block-header">
                            <div class="block-title-wrap">
                                <div class="block-icon-circle pink">
                                    <i class="bi bi-cake2"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h2>Employee Birthdays &amp; Work Anniversaries</h2>
                                    <p>Celebrate team milestones, send warm greetings, and recognize dedicated years of service.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                                <div class="celebrations-nav-toggle">
                                    <button type="button" class="btn-sub-toggle active" onclick="toggleCelebrationsTab('birthdays', this)">
                                        <i class="bi bi-balloon-heart-fill"></i> Birthdays (@celebrationsList.Count(c => c.CelebrationType == "Birthday"))
                                    </button>
                                    <button type="button" class="btn-sub-toggle" onclick="toggleCelebrationsTab('anniversaries', this)">
                                        <i class="bi bi-award-fill"></i> Work Anniversaries (@(celebrationsList.Count(c => c.CelebrationType == "WorkAnniversary") + activeEmployeesList.Count))
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <button type="button" class="btn-add-birthday" onclick="openCreateCelebrationModal()">
                                    <i class="bi bi-cake2-fill"></i> Add Birthday
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Birthdays View (Dynamic) -->
                        <div id="celebrationsBirthdaysView">
                            @{
                                var birthdays = celebrationsList.Where(c => c.CelebrationType == "Birthday").ToList();
                            }
                            @if (!birthdays.Any())
                            {
                                <div class="empty-engage-state">
                                    <i class="bi bi-cake2" style="color:#db2777;"></i>
                                    <h4>No Birthdays Recorded</h4>
                                    <p>No employee birthday celebrations have been added yet. Click "Add Milestone" to record colleague birthdays.</p>
                                    <button type="button" class="btn-add-birthday mt-2" onclick="openCreateCelebrationModal()">
                                        <i class="bi bi-cake2-fill"></i> Add Birthday
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <div class="celebrations-cards-grid">
                                    @foreach (var b in birthdays)
                                    {
                                        bool isToday = b.CelebrationDate.Month == DateTime.Today.Month && b.CelebrationDate.Day == DateTime.Today.Day;
                                        <div class="celebration-user-card @(isToday ? "today" : "")">
                                            @if (isToday)
                                            {
                                                <span class="card-top-ribbon ribbon-today-pink">🎉 Today!</span>
                                            }
                                            <div class="avatar-wrapper">
                                                <div class="avatar-circle-ring pink">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(b.EmployeeName) ? "E" : b.EmployeeName.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())</div>
                                                <div class="avatar-mini-emoji">🎂</div>
                                            </div>
                                            <h4>@b.EmployeeName</h4>
                                            <div class="celebration-subrole">@b.Designation @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(b.Department) ? "• " + b.Department : "")</div>
                                            <div class="celebration-date-badge pink">
                                                <i class="bi bi-stars"></i> @b.CelebrationDate.ToString("MMMM dd")
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-celebration-wish pink flex-grow-1" onclick="showSendWishPopup('@Html.Raw(b.EmployeeName.Replace("'", "\\'"))', 'Birthday', 'Wishing you a very Happy Birthday @Html.Raw(b.EmployeeName.Replace("'", "\\'"))! May your year ahead be blessed with immense joy, health and success! 🎂🎉')">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-send-fill"></i> Send Wishes 🎉
                                                </button>
                                                <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="DeleteCelebration" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this birthday record?');" style="display:inline;">
                                                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@b.Id" />
                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-danger p-0" title="Delete">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-trash3"></i>
                                                    </button>
                                                </form>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>

                        <!-- Anniversaries View (Dynamic from Employees & Celebrations) -->
                        <div id="celebrationsAnniversariesView" style="display:none;">
                            @{
                                var anniversaries = celebrationsList.Where(c => c.CelebrationType == "WorkAnniversary").ToList();
                            }
                            @if (!anniversaries.Any() && !activeEmployeesList.Any())
                            {
                                <div class="empty-engage-state">
                                    <i class="bi bi-award" style="color:#f59e0b;"></i>
                                    <h4>No Work Anniversaries Found</h4>
                                    <p>Work anniversary milestones will automatically appear as employees complete their years of service or when added by HR.</p>
                                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm text-white rounded-pill px-4 mt-2" style="background:#f59e0b;" onclick="openCreateCelebrationModal()">
                                        <i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i> Add Work Milestone
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <div class="celebrations-cards-grid">
                                    <!-- Explicit Milestones added by HR -->
                                    @foreach (var a in anniversaries)
                                    {
                                        <div class="celebration-user-card anniversary">
                                            @if (a.YearsOfService.HasValue)
                                            {
                                                <span class="card-top-ribbon bg-warning text-dark font-weight-bold">🏆 @a.YearsOfService Years</span>
                                            }
                                            <div class="avatar-wrapper">
                                                <div class="avatar-circle-ring amber">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(a.EmployeeName) ? "E" : a.EmployeeName.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())</div>
                                                <div class="avatar-mini-emoji">🎖️</div>
                                            </div>
                                            <h4>@a.EmployeeName</h4>
                                            <div class="celebration-subrole">@a.Designation @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(a.Department) ? "• " + a.Department : "")</div>
                                            <div class="celebration-date-badge gold">
                                                <i class="bi bi-trophy-fill"></i> @(a.YearsOfService.HasValue ? a.YearsOfService + " Years Milestone" : "Anniversary") • @a.CelebrationDate.ToString("MMM dd")
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-celebration-wish gold flex-grow-1" onclick="showSendWishPopup('@Html.Raw(a.EmployeeName.Replace("'", "\\'"))', 'Work Anniversary', 'Heartiest congratulations on your milestone work anniversary @Html.Raw(a.EmployeeName.Replace("'", "\\'"))! Thank you for your leadership and stellar dedication! 🏆👏')">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-award-fill"></i> Congratulate 💐
                                                </button>
                                                <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="DeleteCelebration" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this milestone?');" style="display:inline;">
                                                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@a.Id" />
                                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-danger p-0" title="Delete">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-trash3"></i>
                                                    </button>
                                                </form>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    }

                                    <!-- Auto-calculated Anniversaries from Real Active Employees in Database -->
                                    @foreach (var emp in activeEmployeesList)
                                    {
                                        int years = DateTime.Today.Year - emp.JoiningDate.Year;
                                        if (years <= 0) { years = 1; }
                                        <div class="celebration-user-card anniversary">
                                            <span class="card-top-ribbon bg-purple text-white">🌟 @years @(years > 1 ? "Years" : "Year")</span>
                                            <div class="avatar-wrapper">
                                                <div class="avatar-circle-ring purple">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(emp.FirstName) ? "E" : emp.FirstName.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())</div>
                                                <div class="avatar-mini-emoji">⭐</div>
                                            </div>
                                            <h4>@emp.FullName</h4>
                                            <div class="celebration-subrole">@emp.Designation • @emp.Department</div>
                                            <div class="celebration-date-badge">
                                                <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i> Joined: @emp.JoiningDate.ToString("MMM yyyy")
                                            </div>
                                            <button type="button" class="btn-celebration-wish flex-grow-1" onclick="showSendWishPopup('@Html.Raw(emp.FullName.Replace("'", "\\'"))', 'Work Anniversary', 'Congratulations @Html.Raw(emp.FullName.Replace("'", "\\'")) on your dedication and service at HR Attendance! Your contribution makes our workplace better every day! 🌟💐')">
                                                <i class="bi bi-award-fill"></i> Congratulate 💐
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <!-- =====================================================
                       SECTION 4: ACTIVITIES & EMPLOYEE ENGAGEMENT POSTS
                       ===================================================== -->
                    <section class="engage-block-section" id="block-activities">
                        <div class="engage-block-header">
                            <div class="block-title-wrap">
                                <div class="block-icon-circle orange">
                                    <i class="bi bi-chat-heart"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h2>Activities &amp; Employee Engagement Posts</h2>
                                    <p>Share team moments, give peer recognition, participate in weekly polls, and stay connected.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="activities-social-layout">

                            <!-- Left: Social Feed Stream (DYNAMIC) -->
                            <div class="feed-main-col">

                                <!-- Create Post Box (Submits Real Post to Database) -->
                                <div class="create-post-card">
                                    <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="AddPost" method="post">
                                        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                        <div class="create-post-header">
                                            <div class="my-user-avatar">
                                                @(string.IsNullOrEmpty(User.Identity?.Name) ? "U" : User.Identity.Name.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())
                                            </div>
                                            <textarea name="content" class="create-post-textarea" rows="2" placeholder="Share a team activity, celebrate a win, or give kudos to a colleague..." required></textarea>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="create-post-actions-row">
                                            <div class="post-tags-selector">
                                                <input type="hidden" name="category" id="hiddenPostCategory" value="Shoutout" />
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-tag-select active" onclick="setPostCategoryVal('Shoutout', this)">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-award text-warning"></i> Shoutout
                                                </button>
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-tag-select" onclick="setPostCategoryVal('Activity', this)">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-bicycle text-success"></i> Activity
                                                </button>
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-tag-select" onclick="setPostCategoryVal('Culture', this)">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-cup-hot text-danger"></i> Fun &amp; Culture
                                                </button>
                                                <button type="button" class="btn-tag-select" onclick="setPostCategoryVal('Tech', this)">
                                                    <i class="bi bi-code-slash text-info"></i> Tech Win
                                                </button>
                                            </div>
                                            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit-post">
                                                <i class="bi bi-send"></i> Post Activity
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </form>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Feed Cards Stream (Dynamic from Database) -->
                                <div class="feed-posts-stream" id="socialFeedList">
                                    @if (!postsList.Any())
                                    {
                                        <div class="empty-engage-state">
                                            <i class="bi bi-chat-heart" style="color:#ea580c;"></i>
                                            <h4>No Activity Posts Yet</h4>
                                            <p>Be the first to share a team moment, project milestone, kudos, or celebration update above!</p>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        @foreach (var post in postsList)
                                        {
                                            string catBadge = post.Category switch
                                            {
                                                "Activity" => "sports",
                                                "Culture" => "culture",
                                                "Tech" => "tech",
                                                _ => "kudos"
                                            };
                                            <div class="social-post-card">
                                                <div class="post-header-author">
                                                    <div class="author-id-cluster">
                                                        <div class="author-avatar-img purple">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(post.AuthorName) ? "U" : post.AuthorName.Substring(0, 1).ToUpper())</div>
                                                        <div class="author-text-names">
                                                            <h4>@post.AuthorName</h4>
                                                            <span>@post.CreatedAt.ToString("MMM dd, yyyy • hh:mm tt")</span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                        <span class="badge-post-category @catBadge">@post.Category</span>
                                                        <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="DeletePost" method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this post?');" style="display:inline;">
                                                            @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                                            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@post.Id" />
                                                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-link text-danger p-0" title="Delete">
                                                                <i class="bi bi-trash3"></i>
                                                            </button>
                                                        </form>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>

                                                <div class="post-message-body">
                                                    @post.Content
                                                </div>

                                                <div class="post-counter-stats">
                                                    <div>
                                                        <i class="bi bi-heart-fill text-danger me-1"></i>
                                                        <span id="post-like-count-@post.Id">@post.LikesCount</span> Likes
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div><i class="bi bi-eye me-1"></i> Active</div>
                                                </div>

                                                <div class="post-interaction-buttons">
                                                    <button type="button" class="btn-post-interact" onclick="likePostAjax(@post.Id, 'post-like-count-@post.Id', this)">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-heart"></i> Like
                                                    </button>
                                                    <button type="button" class="btn-post-interact" onclick="focusCommentBox('comment-field-@post.Id')">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-chat-left-dots"></i> Comment
                                                    </button>
                                                    <button type="button" class="btn-post-interact" onclick="triggerToastNotice('Post link copied!')">
                                                        <i class="bi bi-share"></i> Share
                                                    </button>
                                                </div>

                                                <!-- Comments -->
                                                <div class="post-comments-container">
                                                    <div id="dynamicCommentsFeed-@post.Id"></div>
                                                    <div class="write-comment-input-row">
                                                        <input type="text" id="comment-field-@post.Id" placeholder="Write a comment..." onkeypress="handleFeedCommentKey(event, @post.Id)" />
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn-submit-comment" onclick="addFeedComment(@post.Id)">
                                                            <i class="bi bi-arrow-up"></i>
                                                        </button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        }
                                    }
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Right: Sidebar Widgets -->
                            <div class="sidebar-panel-column">

                                <!-- Weekly Team Poll -->
                                <div class="sidebar-card-box">
                                    <h3><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-fill text-purple"></i> Weekly Team Poll</h3>
                                    <div class="poll-widget-title">
                                        What activity would you love for this month's Fun Friday?
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="poll-option-cards">
                                        <div class="poll-single-option" onclick="votePollOption(1)">
                                            <div class="poll-progress-bg" id="pollBar1" style="width: 48%;"></div>
                                            <div class="poll-labels-row">
                                                <span>🍕 Pizza &amp; Board Games</span>
                                                <span class="poll-pct-text" id="pollPct1">48% (38 votes)</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="poll-single-option" onclick="votePollOption(2)">
                                            <div class="poll-progress-bg" id="pollBar2" style="width: 32%;"></div>
                                            <div class="poll-labels-row">
                                                <span>🎸 Retro 90s Dress-Up Day</span>
                                                <span class="poll-pct-text" id="pollPct2">32% (25 votes)</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="poll-single-option" onclick="votePollOption(3)">
                                            <div class="poll-progress-bg" id="pollBar3" style="width: 20%;"></div>
                                            <div class="poll-labels-row">
                                                <span>🧠 Tech Trivia &amp; Kahoot</span>
                                                <span class="poll-pct-text" id="pollPct3">20% (16 votes)</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="poll-footer-info">
                                        <span><i class="bi bi-check2-circle text-success me-1"></i>Live Team Poll</span>
                                        <span>Voting Open</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Pitch an Idea Card -->
                                <div class="sidebar-card-box" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf4ff, #fae8ff); border-color:#f5d0fe;">
                                    <h3 style="color:#701a75;"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb-fill text-warning"></i> Suggest an Activity</h3>
                                    <p class="small text-muted mb-3">
                                        Want to organize a team sports club, lunch-and-learn session, or fitness challenge?
                                        HR welcomes all employee-led initiatives!
                                    </p>
                                    <a asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="ContactUs" class="btn btn-purple btn-sm w-100 rounded-pill">
                                        <i class="bi bi-chat-dots me-1"></i> Send Activity Idea to HR
                                    </a>
                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </section>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- =========================================================
           ENGAGE INTERACTIVE MODALS FOR HR DATA CREATION
           ========================================================= -->

        <!-- Modal 1: Read Announcement -->
        <div class="engage-modal-backdrop" id="engageNoticeDetailModal">
            <div class="engage-modal-window">
                <div class="engage-modal-top">
                    <h4 id="newsModalHeading"><i class="bi bi-newspaper text-purple"></i> Notice Details</h4>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-dismiss-modal" onclick="closeNewsDetailModal()">&times;</button>
                </div>
                <div class="engage-modal-content-area">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-muted small">
                        <span id="newsModalAuthorName" class="fw-bold text-dark"></span>
                        <span>•</span>
                        <span id="newsModalPublishDate"></span>
                    </div>
                    <p id="newsModalFullText" style="line-height:1.7; color:#374151; font-size:0.95rem;"></p>
                </div>
                <div class="engage-modal-bottom">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="closeNewsDetailModal()">Close</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-purple btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="triggerToastNotice('Notice link copied!'); closeNewsDetailModal();">
                        <i class="bi bi-share me-1"></i> Share Notice
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Modal 2: Create New Announcement (Submits to DB) -->
        <div class="engage-modal-backdrop" id="engageCreateNoticeModal">
            <div class="engage-modal-window">
                <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="AddAnnouncement" method="post">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                    <div class="engage-modal-top">
                        <h4><i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill text-purple"></i> Post Announcement</h4>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-dismiss-modal" onclick="closeCreateNoticeModal()">&times;</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-modal-content-area">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Announcement Title</label>
                            <input type="text" name="title" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Q4 Town Hall Notice, Health Policy..." required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Category</label>
                            <select name="category" class="form-select">
                                <option value="General">General Announcement</option>
                                <option value="Policy">HR Policy</option>
                                <option value="Milestone">Company Milestone</option>
                                <option value="Culture">Culture &amp; Fun</option>
                                <option value="Tech">Tech &amp; Innovation</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Details &amp; Description</label>
                            <textarea name="content" class="form-control" rows="4" placeholder="Enter complete announcement details..." required></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-modal-bottom">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="closeCreateNoticeModal()">Cancel</button>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-purple btn-sm rounded-pill px-4">
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle me-1"></i> Publish Announcement
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Modal 3: Add Event / Holiday (Submits to DB) -->
        <div class="engage-modal-backdrop" id="engageCreateEventModal">
            <div class="engage-modal-window">
                <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="AddEvent" method="post">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                    <div class="engage-modal-top">
                        <h4><i class="bi bi-calendar-plus text-primary"></i> Add Event / Holiday</h4>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-dismiss-modal" onclick="closeCreateEventModal()">&times;</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-modal-content-area">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Title</label>
                            <input type="text" name="title" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Diwali Holiday, Annual Sports Gala..." required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Type</label>
                                <select name="eventType" class="form-select">
                                    <option value="CompanyEvent">Company Event</option>
                                    <option value="Holiday">Official Holiday</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Sub-Type / Label</label>
                                <input type="text" name="subType" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Gazetted, Town Hall, Sports" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Date</label>
                                <input type="date" name="eventDate" class="form-control" value="@DateTime.Today.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")" required />
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Location / Mode</label>
                                <input type="text" name="location" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Auditorium, MS Teams" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Description (Optional)</label>
                            <textarea name="description" class="form-control" rows="2" placeholder="Short description or notes..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-modal-bottom">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="closeCreateEventModal()">Cancel</button>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-4">
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle me-1"></i> Save Event
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Modal 4: Add Birthday / Milestone (Submits to DB) -->
        <div class="engage-modal-backdrop" id="engageCreateCelebrationModal">
            <div class="engage-modal-window">
                <form asp-controller="Footer" asp-action="AddCelebration" method="post">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                    <div class="engage-modal-top">
                        <h4><i class="bi bi-gift-fill text-danger"></i> Add Birthday / Milestone</h4>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-dismiss-modal" onclick="closeCreateCelebrationModal()">&times;</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-modal-content-area">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Employee Name</label>
                            <input type="text" name="employeeName" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Rahul Sharma" required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Celebration Type</label>
                                <select name="celebrationType" class="form-select">
                                    <option value="Birthday">Birthday 🎂</option>
                                    <option value="WorkAnniversary">Work Anniversary 🏆</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Date</label>
                                <input type="date" name="celebrationDate" class="form-control" value="@DateTime.Today.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")" required />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Department</label>
                                <input type="text" name="department" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Engineering, HR, Sales" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Designation</label>
                                <input type="text" name="designation" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. Software Engineer" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">Years of Service (For Anniversary)</label>
                            <input type="number" name="yearsOfService" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. 1, 3, 5" min="1" max="50" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-modal-bottom">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="closeCreateCelebrationModal()">Cancel</button>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-purple btn-sm rounded-pill px-4">
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle me-1"></i> Save Milestone
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
